SUMMARY:Lunchbox Lecture - The Capital Area Greenway: The Next 50 Years
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging overview of Raleigh’s Greenway system\, from its early development to the key updates introduced in the 2022 Greenways Master Plan.\nLearn how the plan has shaped operations\, investments\, inter-agency partnerships\, and land‑use decisions\, with a special focus on how these changes support active transportation and everyday commuting along the greenway.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/lunchbox-lecture-the-capital-area-greenway-the-next-50-years/
LOCATION:City of Raleigh Museum\, 220 Fayetteville Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/greenway-history-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The City of Raleigh Museum":MAILTO:cormuseum@gmail.com
GEO:35.7776508;-78.6397629
