SUMMARY:Spellbound at Mordecai
DESCRIPTION:Magic and mayhem abound at Spellbound at Mordecai\, presented in partnership with Paper & Stars Studio!\nDecorate a pumpkin to take home\, shop for enchanting handmade items and treats\, and meet mysterious characters. Enjoy family-friendly stage performances\, inflatables\, crafts\, and more. Wear your best Halloween finery to enter the costume contest. Prizes will be awarded for best children’s costume and best group costume! \nJoin The Ghost Guild\, Inc. for their annual Haunted Mordecai presentation\, which includes immersive tours in the very locations where their data was collected. Reserve your tickets in advance on The Ghost Guild’s Eventbrite page or on a first-come\, first-served basis on the day of the event. \nThis is a family event full of spooky fun for children – no horror\, gore\, weapons\, or full masks\, please.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/spellbound-at-mordecai/
LOCATION:Mordecai Historic Park\, 1 Mimosa Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27604\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2025_Spellbound-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
